p("Evidence timing: status figures in this document are a snapshot from 14 October 2026 at approximately 15:11 IST. They are not a fresh measurement at document-opening time.", "Small")

page("The installed configuration proves the C: paths", 2)
h("1. Elasticsearch data and log paths")
p("The following active, uncommented entries were read from the installed configuration file. These are local configuration values, not inferred defaults. [L2]")
p(r"C:\Program Files\Eurotherm\Eurotherm Reviewer\ElasticSearch\config\elasticsearch.yml", "Code")
p(r"path.data: C:\ProgramData\Eurotherm\Reviewer\es7\data", "Code")
p(r"path.logs: C:\ProgramData\Eurotherm\Reviewer\es7\logs", "Code")
