h("Can the internal data be moved to D:?")
p("The configured paths demonstrate a storage configuration, but they do not establish a supported Eurotherm relocation method. Confirm support for database, archive, configuration, queues, permissions, upgrade behavior and recovery before making changes. A generic path edit, directory move or junction is not a verified migration procedure for this installation.")
p("Elastic advises against modifying files inside its data directory and directs administrators to supported snapshot/restore mechanisms. Eurotherm’s complete application backup/restore requirements may add further steps. [W2]")

page("Recommended IT actions and verification", 6)
h("Immediate recovery")
p("1. Have IT review C: disk usage and recover or extend capacity through normal approved maintenance. Preserve Reviewer’s database, archives and queues. This document is an explanation and plan; no cleanup, threshold change, database edit or service change was performed.")
p("2. Check free capacity again and verify the native Reviewer status. Look for indexingEnable=true and healthy native disk/indexing status. Do not assume that returning above 5 GB immediately restores every service or fixes the report workflow.")
p("3. Run diagnostics from the Python project. For an available-data test, use latestAvailable explicitly. The production October interval still needs actual matching Group 6 recordings. Keep test results distinct from operational reports.")
p("4. Generate a labelled historical PDF only after preflight passes, then verify title, instrument/group, all expected channels and exact boundaries. A successful diagnostic is not a substitute for checking the actual PDF.")
