p("The automation must also be reviewed after a supported storage change. Both implementations currently build archive paths under C:\\ProgramData\\Eurotherm\\Reviewer\\archive, and readiness code explicitly considers C: free space. Those assumptions must be updated and tested against the new approved layout. Relocating only the Elasticsearch data path would not automatically update either assumption. [L4]")
h("Long-term capacity")
p("Plan capacity from recording points, sample interval, retention, device count, archive growth and report/log retention. Set a monitoring and response policy with IT and the product owner. The currently observed 5 GB guard is not a complete capacity plan.")

